This repository contains code adapted from third-party projects.

agent-council (https://github.com/apolenkov/agent-council)

Run side (src/council): parts of src/council/members.ts, parse.ts, review-dir.ts and run.ts
adapt ideas and code from hooks/model/members.ts, hooks/model/parse.ts, hooks/model/detect.ts,
hooks/model/diff-input.ts and hooks/effects/run-member.ts.

Synthesis side (src/council): adapted files hooks/model/jev.ts, hooks/model/jev-summary.ts,
hooks/model/summary.ts, hooks/model/format.ts and hooks/effects/summarize.ts. Used in
src/council/synth.ts and src/council/format.ts (two-round Jev scoring, clustering by
"same as #k", contradiction check, request packing and the 9 question / 14,000 character /
20 finding calibration).

